Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ided by holy
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.28,0:00:13.74,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shijima no soko kara
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.28,0:00:13.74,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,From out of the stillness
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.37,0:00:17.58,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mezameru sono hashira tachi
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.37,0:00:17.58,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The Pillars of the past are awakening
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.58,0:00:20.96,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Toki wo koe
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.58,0:00:20.96,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,To the dawn of a new day
Dialogue: 3,0:00:20.96,0:00:28.22,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shinku no chishio ga
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.96,0:00:28.22,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The river of crimson blood within you
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.97,0:00:34.76,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.97,0:00:34.76,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Carries with it the courage to stand and fight
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.97,0:00:34.76,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.77,0:00:43.48,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Uketsugu ai wo sadame to yobu nara
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.77,0:00:43.48,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Even if the love I feel is just part of my legacy...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.48,0:00:49.57,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hohoemu me de tsugi no te wo
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.48,0:00:49.57,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll still be smiling as I stay one step ahead
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.36,0:00:56.20,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yami wo azamuite setsuna wo kawashite
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.36,0:00:56.20,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Defying the darkness and dodging death at every turn
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.20,0:01:00.04,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yaiba surinuke yatsura no suki wo tsuke
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.20,0:01:00.04,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Slipping past the knife's edge and striking when you least expect
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.04,0:01:05.46,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tsuranuita omoi ga mirai wo hiraku
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.04,0:01:05.46,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The emotions running through me blaze a path to the future...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.24,0:01:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.30,0:01:08.55,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.30,0:01:08.55,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.55,0:01:10.80,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.55,0:01:10.80,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.55,0:01:10.80,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.55,0:01:10.80,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.80,0:01:14.64,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ketsumyaku ni kizamareta innen ni
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.80,0:01:14.64,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,When the time comes to end the vendetta carried by our blood
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.64,0:01:20.44,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ukiagaru kienai hokori no kizuna
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.64,0:01:20.44,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember that the bonds of pride will carry you through any storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.44,0:01:25.48,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Nigirishimete
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.44,0:01:25.48,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,So hold them close
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.49,0:01:35.49,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,640)\pos(1247,865)\fscx78\blur1}Episode 23: "The Warrior Returns to the Wind" {Toni, Check that the title matches the preview at the end of 22 -Fadeout4}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.49,0:01:35.49,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,640)\pos(1230,865)}Episode 23: "The Warrior of Wind" {Toni, Check that the title matches the preview at the end of 22 -Fadeout4}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.40,0:01:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of the air, it seems to\Nbe flowing over to Wamuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.04,0:01:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My ultimate mastery, atmospheric rift!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.48,0:01:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's only wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're near the flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:01:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sense it, though I can't\Nsee exactly where that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:02:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I am going to find you eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.96,0:02:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I've prevented you from\Ngathering your Hormone energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.64,0:02:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to cut you in half!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.88,0:02:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atmospheric Rift is Wamuu's\Nsupreme final weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.74,0:02:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pipes he uses to\Ncloak himself take in huge
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.14,0:02:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,amounts of air and then\Nunbelievably compress it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The air is then blasted from\Nan orifice thinner than paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.88,0:02:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a razor made of wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.74,0:02:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it creates heat and friction\Nat levels terrible even for Wamuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.58,0:02:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His body cannot handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.70,0:02:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.60,0:02:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he is certainly a breathtaking\Nfigure, tragic and heroic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.54,0:02:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Victory is yours, Wamuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.70,0:02:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take his life as a bomb\Nfor your wound. Shoujo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.94,0:02:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting close!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to pull off one of\Nmy famous tricks now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.70,0:02:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's called the Apollo Oil Trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.26,0:02:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His lungs are literally\Nhigh-pressure oxygen tanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.46,0:03:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those pipes, if I can only hit\Nthem, he'd inhale the flaming oil?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.40,0:03:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which in turn would create\Nan internal explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.46,0:03:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is the very\Nlast ace up my sleeve!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I mess it up...
