Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.68,0:03:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your life is mine, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.08,0:03:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's your choice, fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.32,0:03:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can sense anything that is\Nfar enough away from the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're out of tricks and that cry\Nof yours gave away your position.
