Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was when I threw Caesar's bandana. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.86,0:04:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.10,0:04:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I meant for you to cut the\Nbottle in half the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.40,0:04:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your ability to do it so quickly and\Neasily is what led to your downfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The oil inside of it is now vaporizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.44,0:04:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And look, you see the bandana?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.82,0:04:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the pieces flying around?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.86,0:04:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every little fragment is still on\Nfire, and they're entering my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.16,0:04:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamuu, you have been a\Nworthy and admirable fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.54,0:04:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a powerful ally named Caesar\Nwas with me throughout this contest.
