Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.94,0:05:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.08,0:05:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Wamuu, how could he have lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, be careful, he can regenerate,\Neven like that after being blown to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.44,0:05:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to use your strongest\Nhormone to destroy him completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.18,0:05:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it is finally over now, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.18,0:05:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.90,0:05:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You took revenge for Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.58,0:05:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.60,0:05:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.90,0:05:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will!
