Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.86,0:06:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.74,0:06:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That smoke isn't from the flaming oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.04,0:06:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming from your wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.26,0:06:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hormone from your\Narms spread through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.04,0:06:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every part of you is infected now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.24,0:06:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are dissolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.62,0:06:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only imagine the agony you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.54,0:06:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't prevent you from dying now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.06,0:06:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My blood can at least ease your pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.56,0:06:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to shame me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have made peace with myself. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.76,0:06:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need pity from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.04,0:06:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.78,0:06:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That this is done out of pity for you? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you destroy Caesar's bubble of\Nblood that carried his bandana and ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.52,0:06:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knowing full well that they\Nposed a serious threat to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.42,0:06:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was because the man was\Na worthy and noble warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.92,0:06:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He deserved to be honored for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.16,0:06:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you'll say next is,\NJojo, you can't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.32,0:07:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, you can't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do, Wamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.78,0:07:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The honor you showed my friend, Caesar's\Nwarrior spirit, had earned your respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.86,0:07:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So in return, I wanted to find a\Nway to honor your warrior spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.26,0:07:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My blood is a tribute to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.40,0:07:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You beat me, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.36,0:07:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as a warrior, it would now appear\Nthat you stand taller than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.92,0:07:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,EA, kill the bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.42,0:07:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.62,0:07:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What betrayal is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
