Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.92,0:07:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.92,0:07:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Wamuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.60,0:08:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although sworn to Lord Kars, I will\Nnot allow the vampires to attack you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not because of sentiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.56,0:08:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told Caesar this as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.92,0:08:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To me, only the strong truly existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Victory was the single\Nquality to be admired.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I existed only according\Nto my own code of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.80,0:08:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, please understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.66,0:08:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To me, immortality was something\Nutterly unimportant and trivial.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that has ever mattered to\Nme was living up to my code.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, I desire that you\Nshould drink the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.48,0:08:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must do it before I\Ndissolve completely away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.34,0:08:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't see it though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.02,0:08:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need eyes, words, or a horn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.90,0:08:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What matters is that you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.10,0:08:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am glad I was able to witness\Nyour growth as a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the reason I\Nlived these thousands of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.50,0:09:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,years was so that I could\Nmeet you at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell to you, Warrior Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.86,0:09:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamu became one with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.02,0:09:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo gave his opponent one final salute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.04,0:09:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though no tears fell, they\Nhad shared a silent song.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.46,0:09:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They had shared a warrior's affinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.20,0:09:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamuu, you must kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.18,0:09:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, my lord Kars, with utmost respect,\Nhe is only an innocent young boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:09:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true. Just a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the reason he must die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.88,0:10:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If these Hormone users\Nare allowed to live,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.64,0:10:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're likely to become\Nour mortal enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.18,0:10:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And humans grow very quickly indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.56,0:10:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it beyond you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.88,0:10:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem I must\Ndemonstrate how it is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.30,0:10:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, in resolving the problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.70,0:10:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is handled like this, Wamuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.50,0:10:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was too pure in his warrior philosophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.12,0:10:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he became weak as a result.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.62,0:10:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's the end of Wamuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.94,0:10:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.06,0:10:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a disappointment. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.76,0:10:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's only a poser.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your followers are such base creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.98,0:10:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makes me want to vomit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.62,0:10:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't curse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.02,0:10:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I alone am the only one to remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.78,0:11:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because this world and
