Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.59,0:11:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Kars, there's no reason for you to\Nwaste time on any one-on-one battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.84,0:11:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.04,0:11:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us kill these two for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.38,0:11:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or you lord will turn\Nthem into spades of blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.78,0:11:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what I thought you would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.86,0:11:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.56,0:11:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The redstone! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.32,0:11:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me against Kars, one-on-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.66,0:11:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if those terms aren't to your liking,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why don't I just smash this\Nthing right here and now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.14,0:11:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will honor my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.06,0:11:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A one-on-one fight. Count on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.52,0:11:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My promise stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.16,0:11:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is why I chose to\Nreveal my horn to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.72,0:12:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for my underlings' behavior, as you\Ncan clearly see, they are already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.08,0:12:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Lord Coors!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I want is that red stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.66,0:12:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, AC/DC and Wamuu were\Nmy comrades for 10,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.30,0:12:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no choice but to honor both their\Nwarrior deaths and their warrior pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.56,0:12:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will fight you Hamon users fairly,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.30,0:12:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then I will finish\Nthis with my own two hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.70,0:12:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For you, Lisa Lisa,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seeing the fighter you are, I will\Nnot think of you as merely a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.62,0:12:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will fight you with all the\Nstrength I have at my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.10,0:12:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.46,0:12:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is where we shall fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.74,0:12:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Temple at Pies Bernina.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.34,0:12:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Champions of battle would come here to\Ndrink the blood of those they had felled,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mixed with liquor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.64,0:12:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They thanked the gods\Nfor the gift of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.52,0:13:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not an arena, but it\Nwill serve for our fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.40,0:13:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coach Lisa Lisa, you may be extremely\Nskilled, but you are still a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.60,0:13:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't look as strong as Wamu was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.80,0:13:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me take him for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.34,0:13:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not.
