Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.06,0:13:14.11,SFXBrown,11.2,0,0,0,,{=61}{\alpha&H09&\frz7.765\pos(756.37,31.52)}Whoom
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.11,0:13:14.15,SFXBrown,11.2,0,0,0,,{=61}{\alpha&H2B&\frz7.765\pos(768.89,20.14)}Whoom
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.15,0:13:14.19,SFXBrown,11.2,0,0,0,,{=61}{\alpha&H4D&\frz7.765\pos(788.24,17.86)}Whoom
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.18,0:13:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't live my life\Nas I did and train all
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.19,0:13:14.23,SFXBrown,11.2,0,0,0,,{=61}{\alpha&H6F&\frz7.765\pos(796.21,15.02)}Whoom
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.23,0:13:14.27,SFXBrown,11.2,0,0,0,,{=61}{\alpha&H99&\frz7.765\pos(829.79,35.51)}Whoom
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.27,0:13:14.31,SFXBrown,11.2,0,0,0,,{=61}{\alpha&HBB&\frz7.765\pos(832.64,37.22)}Whoom
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.31,0:13:14.36,SFXBrown,11.2,0,0,0,,{=61}{\alpha&HDD&\frz7.765\pos(857.68,28.68)}Whoom
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.00,0:13:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those years to be replaced by\Nsome stripling. Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have lived a lot of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.36,0:13:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall use my brilliant bone blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.88,0:13:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would offend Wamu's memory if I didn't\Noffer you the weapon of your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feel free to pick anything you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.88,0:13:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My scarf will be more than sufficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.86,0:13:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, let's fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.60,0:13:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no violence in his stance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.32,0:13:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can he fight without violence?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.70,0:13:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.14,0:13:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you not ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:14:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, the first move is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.26,0:14:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He disappeared completely\Nin that sudden white light.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.54,0:14:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.29,0:14:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he seems to be coming\Nfrom above as well as below.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.74,0:14:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack of the brilliant Boneblade!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.74,0:14:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, in the pillar, there's a crack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.14,0:14:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snake Muffler!
