Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.58,0:14:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.70,0:14:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you don't know is\Nthis Satoporosia Beetle
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scarf is able to conduct\Nhormone energy perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's both a deadly weapon\Nand a life detector.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.70,0:14:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it protects against\Nbeing attacked from behind!
