Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.32,0:15:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kars is behind her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.54,0:15:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.90,0:15:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's at her feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.48,0:15:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.28,0:15:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.22,0:15:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaz wasn't the one fighting\Nwith her, he used a double!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph, what stupidity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.56,0:15:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I ever choose\Nto fight one-on-one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.62,0:15:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing I wanted out\Nof this was the Red Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.84,0:15:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because I planned to become\Nthe ultimate life form.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.06,0:15:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not a warrior philosopher like\NWamuu was, nor am I a romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.62,0:15:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter the method\Nutilized, in the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.72,0:15:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Victory is the only thing that matters!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.74,0:16:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, that's why I sensed no violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.38,0:16:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He never had any intention of fighting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.20,0:16:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over!
