Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.44,0:16:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're homo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.96,0:16:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's working anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.16,0:16:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're weak now, so\Nwe're— Rebuff Overdrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.98,0:17:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, you look completely worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.96,0:17:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your breathing is ragged.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.88,0:17:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Hamon level is weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.26,0:17:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're the only one left out of all\Nof the Hamon users that Lisa Lisa trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you last?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you last?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.24,0:17:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, think you can beat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He-he-he, hmmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.02,0:17:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.66,0:17:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's rip off his skin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.94,0:17:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap! You can try!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.36,0:17:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That light!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that face!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.96,0:17:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your warning, Vampires!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.84,0:17:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are now facing Major von\NStroheim, the German elite!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.38,0:17:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we represent the special forces of\Nthe Speedwagon Foundation! Jojo! Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.94,0:17:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Da!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.85,0:18:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon, you look great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.36,0:18:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Smokey, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.66,0:18:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a sight for sore eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.24,0:18:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My right leg might be stiff now, but my\Nbody is better than it ever was before!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.88,0:18:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now all your vampires will see\Nwhat German science can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.84,0:18:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's an ultraviolet bloodline!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.36,0:18:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the Speedwagon Foundation\Nthat made them small enough to carry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.78,0:18:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But our boy does like to brag.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.75,0:18:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crafty creatures, no question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.84,0:18:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.84,0:18:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see Jojo down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.56,0:18:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gone again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.54,0:18:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're just as quick as ever, aren't\Nyou? Take my eyes off you for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.06,0:18:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and there you are putting another\Nlittle scheme in play you crossed a line
