Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.94,0:19:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no honor earns you no consideration\Nyou said it would be a fair fight but
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.76,0:19:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attacked Lisa Lisa in a cowardly ambush\Nthereby showing what you're made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.34,0:19:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you have betrayed the honor\Nand memory of your friend, Wam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.40,0:19:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save your indignation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.18,0:19:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your outrage means nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.22,0:19:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any action is a means to\Nan end for what I desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.66,0:19:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing that matters\Nto me is the Red Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.14,0:19:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Battling over thousands of years means\Nminimizing danger, not taking any risk?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.36,0:19:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and moving your pawns\Nvery carefully indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.58,0:19:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what the battle has been about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.12,0:19:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to show you how good I am at this,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.90,0:19:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to maneuver you effortlessly\Nto your death. Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.12,0:19:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your information, Kars!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.26,0:19:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never hated anyone before\Nthis day, but you I hate!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.02,0:19:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really hate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.82,0:19:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then show me, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.90,0:19:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go one-on-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.54,0:19:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have that fair\Nfight you wanted to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.70,0:20:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisa Lisa is almost dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not completely yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.02,0:20:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left her alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.58,0:20:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My plan is to let her live for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.90,0:20:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why would I do that?\NShe's just another pawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.70,0:20:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a worthless little pawn\NI Can use against you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.18,0:20:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You utter bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.00,0:20:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I've tied her feet\Ntogether with this rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.24,0:20:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.12,0:20:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I do such a thing as this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.82,0:20:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is why!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.04,0:20:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisa Lisa, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Off you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.08,0:20:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she hits the ground, she'll be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.24,0:20:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't save her in a few seconds,\Nshe'll be a Lisa-Lisa-shaped splatter!
