Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.92,0:21:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisa-Lisa! Huh? Lisa-Lisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.14,0:21:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Lisa-Lisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.68,0:21:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean to say she's the baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.30,0:21:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the ship Granny Arena told us about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.06,0:21:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that means she is JoJo's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.92,0:21:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you can't move from that spot,\Nhere's how efficient battle can be, JoJo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.18,0:21:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll very calmly walk right up to you and\Nslice you to pieces while you can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.42,0:21:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cars, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a place waiting for you in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.72,0:21:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.32,0:21:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know the woman he's\Ntrying to save is his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.58,0:22:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.76,0:22:09.35,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.06,0:22:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The words will make you out and out.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.35,0:22:12.81,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,The words will make you out 'n' out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.78,0:22:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.81,0:22:18.15,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.86,0:22:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it morning, driving through the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.15,0:22:20.82,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.82,0:22:25.37,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.90,0:22:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in and out the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.30,0:22:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The music dance and sing.
